TEXT 448 40 Left 2 ;In the symmetric operation case\nthere is no difference if the lines\nare coupled or not
TEXT 792 -104 Left 5 ;NOTE: In this example only the inductive coupling is considered\n3 phase symmetric operation mode and\nfault operation mode (1 phase)
